@startuml http_result_bean_compatibility
title ResultBeanAdapter Standalone and Company Replacement

' Source evidence (pi-mono-java 8691e8800f05f28afe22499050c29220ef5b7475):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/result/ResultBeanAdapter.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/result/StandaloneResultBeanAdapter.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java.
' Observed behavior: controllers depend on ResultBeanAdapter and standalone code provides the approved JSON shape.
' Java divergence: the internal ResultBeanFactory artifact is not available in the standalone repository.
' Design reason: company code replaces one Spring bean without inventing an internal FQCN or duplicate class.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #C2410C
  FontColor #7C2D12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
package "Business source" {
  class "SessionController" as Controller
  class "RuntimeApiExceptionHandler" as Handler
}

interface "ResultBeanAdapter" as Contract
class "StandaloneResultBeanAdapter\nresCode, resMsg, result" as Standalone
class "Company ResultBeanAdapter Bean" as CompanyAdapter
class "Company ResultBeanFactory" as Company
class "Company Maven settings" as Settings

class "MessageSource\nen-US and zh-CN" as Messages

Controller --> Contract : normal(result)
Handler --> Contract : error(code, message)
Handler --> Messages : resolve error code and arguments
Standalone ..|> Contract
CompanyAdapter ..|> Contract
CompanyAdapter --> Company : getFactory().normal(result)
Settings --> Company : resolves artifact

note bottom of Contract
Standalone builds do not define a fake company FQCN.
Internal coordinates, repository URLs, credentials, and unverified methods
remain outside the public repository.
end note
@enduml

